**/google_credentials.json
**/linkedin_token.json
**/*_token.json
**/token.json
**/client_secret*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# === Runtime state, databases, logs ===
data/
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.log
**/*.lock

# === Skill runtime state + staged business documents (NEVER commit) ===
